    "name": "Wonderia",
    "steam_appid": 2593340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Explore 'Wonderia', a unique open-world game set on an alien planet. Your journey combines survival, creativity, and exploration in a dynamic, procedurally generated environment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/3ed49ef8cd042a9df780ce9c91976aba.poster.avif?t=1753254580\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/3ed49ef8cd042a9df780ce9c91976aba.webm?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/3ed49ef8cd042a9df780ce9c91976aba.mp4?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/b815f6515d2ad3387c06d47847f9aaba.avif?t=1753254580\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Build and customize homes for space travelers, influencing them to make this world their new home. Your constructions directly affect the planet's landscape and ecosystem.<br><br>Discover a vast, ever-changing sandbox world. Uncover resources and secrets hidden across diverse landscapes, each offering unique challenges and opportunities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/83d0c1f03f953f5ec23ce8d3b3da9f9a.poster.avif?t=1753254580\" width=610 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/83d0c1f03f953f5ec23ce8d3b3da9f9a.webm?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/83d0c1f03f953f5ec23ce8d3b3da9f9a.mp4?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Delve into mysterious dungeons scattered across the planet. Navigate through complex labyrinths and uncover hidden treasures in these subterranean realms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/fishing.gif?t=1753254580\" width=610 height=122 /></span><br>Cultivate an alien garden, planting seeds collected on your travels. Delve into the art of fishing, capturing exotic aquatic species in hidden nooks of the planet. <br><br>Experiment with your harvests and catches in the kitchen, concocting culinary creations that offer surprising benefits.<br><br>Enjoy 'Wonderia' solo or with up to 7 others in multiplayer mode. Work together or compete in constructing, exploring, and surviving on this alien planet.<br><br>'Wonderia' offers a blend of adventure and creativity, where your decisions shape the world and your experience in this alien landscape.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/114a8c7ea2ab2e51f3cfbdc10565724d.poster.avif?t=1753254580\" width=610 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/114a8c7ea2ab2e51f3cfbdc10565724d.webm?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/114a8c7ea2ab2e51f3cfbdc10565724d.mp4?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Explore 'Wonderia', a unique open-world game set on an alien planet. Your journey combines survival, creativity, and exploration in a dynamic, procedurally generated environment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/3ed49ef8cd042a9df780ce9c91976aba.poster.avif?t=1753254580\" width=610 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/3ed49ef8cd042a9df780ce9c91976aba.webm?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/3ed49ef8cd042a9df780ce9c91976aba.mp4?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/b815f6515d2ad3387c06d47847f9aaba.avif?t=1753254580\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Build and customize homes for space travelers, influencing them to make this world their new home. Your constructions directly affect the planet's landscape and ecosystem.<br><br>Discover a vast, ever-changing sandbox world. Uncover resources and secrets hidden across diverse landscapes, each offering unique challenges and opportunities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/83d0c1f03f953f5ec23ce8d3b3da9f9a.poster.avif?t=1753254580\" width=610 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/83d0c1f03f953f5ec23ce8d3b3da9f9a.webm?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/83d0c1f03f953f5ec23ce8d3b3da9f9a.mp4?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Delve into mysterious dungeons scattered across the planet. Navigate through complex labyrinths and uncover hidden treasures in these subterranean realms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/fishing.gif?t=1753254580\" width=610 height=122 /></span><br>Cultivate an alien garden, planting seeds collected on your travels. Delve into the art of fishing, capturing exotic aquatic species in hidden nooks of the planet. <br><br>Experiment with your harvests and catches in the kitchen, concocting culinary creations that offer surprising benefits.<br><br>Enjoy 'Wonderia' solo or with up to 7 others in multiplayer mode. Work together or compete in constructing, exploring, and surviving on this alien planet.<br><br>'Wonderia' offers a blend of adventure and creativity, where your decisions shape the world and your experience in this alien landscape.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/114a8c7ea2ab2e51f3cfbdc10565724d.poster.avif?t=1753254580\" width=610 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/114a8c7ea2ab2e51f3cfbdc10565724d.webm?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/114a8c7ea2ab2e51f3cfbdc10565724d.mp4?t=1753254580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Wonderia's an open-world, manga-art adventure just waiting to be explored. It's got sci-fi sim elements, deep dungeons, and you can even morph into alien form! Grab up to 7 friends to mine, craft, battle, and level\u2014or farm and fish the day away, if that's more your tempo. There's so much to do!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
